<p>
<md>\pi_1(S^1).</md>
</p>
</statement>
</exercise>

<exercise>
<statement>
<p>State</p>

<p>
<md>\pi_1(T^2).</md>
</p>
</statement>
</exercise>

<exercise>
<statement>
<p>What does it mean for a space to be simply connected?</p>
</statement>
</exercise>

<exercise>
<statement>
<p>Give an example of a path-connected space that is not simply connected.</p>
</statement>
</exercise>

<exercise>
<statement>
