<statement>
<p>Use the previous exercise to determine</p>

<p>
<md>\pi_1(\R^2\setminus\{0\}).</md>
</p>
</statement>
</exercise>

<exercise>
<statement>
<p>Explain geometrically why</p>

<p>
<md>\pi_1(S^1)\cong\Z.</md>
