<exercise>
<statement>
<p>For the covering</p>

<p>
<md>p(t)=e^{2\pi i t},</md>
</p>

<p>find the fiber over <m>1\in S^1</m>.</p>
</statement>
</exercise>

<exercise>
<statement>
<p>Describe the deck transformations of</p>

<p>
